## Configuration

```ruby
# config/frai.rb
Frai.configure do |config|
  config.model   = ENV["LLM_MODEL"]     # e.g. "claude-opus-4-6", "gpt-4o"
  config.api_key = ENV["LLM_API_KEY"]
end
```

The `:null` adapter returns the rendered prompt without making an LLM call — useful for testing.

